Icon licenses
=============

Icons in this directory come from the Simple Icons project
(https://simpleicons.org), which releases its set under CC0 1.0
except where an icon declares its own license. Every shipped icon's
upstream license metadata was audited; the table below is the
required attribution for the icons that are not CC0.

Unless noted, SVGs were modified to inherit `fill="currentColor"` so
GoRex can tint them; modified copies of share-alike or copyleft icons
stay under the same license, and each file carries an
SPDX-License-Identifier comment. `unmodified` files ship verbatim
because their license forbids derivatives.

Icons remain trademarks of their respective owners and are used only
to identify the programs they depict. Licenses marked `custom` point
at vendor brand guidelines; this use is nominative (naming the
program the icon depicts), which those policies allow.

